    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "@stuartarchibald   Thank you for your advice. \r\nBut I think this is still calculate OLS(regression) one by one ,  the GPU power is just for one OLS(regression)  not for all the OLS simultaneously . So in the loop  ```for trDate_j in range(trDateNum):```  the cupy is just do one OLS in GPU  . \r\n\r\nI don't think this is faster than CPU version . \r\n\r\nMaybe I should try something that can do massive OLS  simultaneously in GPU . ",
